3. USER WORKFLOW (CRITICAL PATH)
Critical Path: Generate and View a Travel Itinerary
User visits the web app (defaults to English).
User enters destination and travel dates.
System calls OpenAI and Google APIs to fetch recommendations.
User sees a structured daily itinerary within 4 seconds.
Each day’s locations appear on a Google Map.
User logs in to save itinerary.
User can re-open itineraries in “My Trips” dashboard.
Outcome:
User completes an end-to-end flow of generating, viewing, saving, and reloading an itinerary.

4. BUSINESS RULES
No booking or payment functionality in MVP.
Public travel data only.
Data stored by user, deletable at any time.
Max 5 itineraries per user in MVP.

